WEBVTT

00:19:26.352 --> 00:19:30.456
Follow traces. Get lost. Be surprised, amused inspired.

00:19:30.456 --> 00:19:35.075
All that 'what', all that 'how' is out there

00:19:35.075 --> 00:19:37.538
waiting for you to discover its 'why',

00:19:37.569 --> 00:19:40.627
to dive in and pass it on.

00:19:40.627 --> 00:19:43.125
Thank you.

00:19:43.125 --> 00:19:50.237
(Applause)